applications/caelundas/output

# The `start` command's mosaic tiles are committed alongside the rest of
# `output/`, but their contact sheets are not: each one embeds every SVG of
# its row count inline, so committing them would duplicate the whole sweep a
# second time for no extra information. `nx run meanderaw:build` rebuilds
# them whenever they are wanted.
applications/meanderaw/output/permutations/*.html
vite.config.*.timestamp*
data/**
.fallow

